<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="command">conjure-earth</ansi> spell

The <ansi fg="command">Conjure Earth Elemental</ansi> spell drags a hulking earth elemental into
the world and shackles it as your companion. Earth elementals are the
slowest of the conjurable elementals but among the most durable — their
immense mass lets them knock foes prone without needing a shield, and
they absorb punishment that would shatter lesser creatures. What they
cost in speed they repay in sheer implacable force.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast conjure-earth</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Neutral
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Manifestation
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> 6
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> Heavy

<ansi fg="white-bold">Notes:</ansi>
  - No component is required to cast this spell.
  - Earth elementals have a natural bash ability.
  - The elemental persists until destroyed or dismissed.
  - Scaling improves with your Charisma and Manifestation skill.
  - You cannot exceed your companion limit with this spell.

